<section class="nx-panel" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="nx-panel-head"><h2>Autenticación empresarial · OpenID Connect</h2><span class="nx-pill">OIDC + PKCE S256</span></div><form method="post" class="nx-panel-body nx-stack"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="oidc"><div class="nx-form-grid"><label>Issuer HTTPS<input name="oidc_issuer" type="url" maxlength="255" value="<?= $e(\App\Core\Settings::get('oidc_issuer')) ?>"></label><label>Client ID<input name="oidc_client_id" maxlength="255" value="<?= $e(\App\Core\Settings::get('oidc_client_id')) ?>"></label><label>Client secret<input name="oidc_secret" type="password" maxlength="2000" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Deja vacío para conservar"></label><label>Tu contraseña administrativa actual<input type="password" name="current_password" required maxlength="72"></label></div><label class="nx-check"><input type="checkbox" name="oidc_enabled" value="1" <?= \App\Core\Settings::get('oidc_enabled')==='1'?'checked':'' ?>>Habilitar acceso empresarial</label><p class="nx-note">Callback: <?= $e(rtrim(\App\Core\Environment::get('APP_URL'),'/').'/login/enterprise') ?>. Requiere registrar una aplicación en tu proveedor y probarla con sus credenciales. No se conceden roles desde correos ni atributos externos. SAML y SCIM no están incluidos en este módulo.</p><button class="nx-btn">Guardar proveedor</button></form></section>
